:1rem;}.wsp-related-card{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;}.wsp-related-card a{font-weight:700;color:var(--global-palette1, #3182CE);text-decoration:none;}.wsp-related-card a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.wsp-related-card p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem;color:#555;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call{background:#E0A83C !important;border:2px solid #E0A83C !important;color:#16203A !important;font-size:1.25rem !important;font-weight:800 !important;padding:1rem 2.2rem !important;border-radius:40px !important;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(224,168,60,.25),0 8px 26px rgba(224,168,60,.5) !important;text-shadow:none !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call strong{color:#16203A !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call:hover{background:#fff !important;border-color:#fff !important;}</style><div class='wsp-hero'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Arkansas Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights: Rules for Selling a Rental</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Arkansas</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Arkansas Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Arkansas Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights sale</li><li>Turn the Arkansas Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Arkansas House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>Arkansas statutes set the basic rules between landlords and tenants, including deposits, notices and what happens when a rental is sold.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>Security deposit may not exceed two months&#x27; rent; the AG notes the security-deposit law applies only to landlords who rent six or more units. (Arkansas Attorney General, Landlord And Tenant Rights (security deposits); <a href='https://arkansasag.gov/divisions/public-protection/homes/landlord-and-tenant-rights/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Landlord must return the deposit within 60 days after the tenant moves out and, if deducting, provide a written itemized list of charges within 60 days of vacating; entire deposit may be withheld if damages or unpaid rent exceed it. (Arkansas Attorney General, Landlord And Tenant Rights; <a href='https://arkansasag.gov/divisions/public-protection/homes/landlord-and-tenant-rights/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Landlord must give notice of at least one rental period before raising rent, for oral and written leases. (Arkansas Attorney General, Landlord And Tenant Rights; <a href='https://arkansasag.gov/divisions/public-protection/homes/landlord-and-tenant-rights/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>A landlord may give notice of lease termination for any reason: one rental period&#x27;s notice for an oral lease, or notice per the terms of a written lease. (Arkansas Attorney General, Landlord And Tenant Rights; <a href='https://arkansasag.gov/divisions/public-protection/homes/landlord-and-tenant-rights/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>AG states Arkansas laws on these issues apply only to private rental units, not government-subsidized housing. (Arkansas Attorney General, Landlord And Tenant Rights; <a href='https://arkansasag.gov/divisions/public-protection/homes/landlord-and-tenant-rights/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Arkansas?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Arkansas houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/arkansas-eviction-notice/'>Arkansas Eviction Notice: Types and Days</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/arkansas-tax-deed-and-tax-lien-sales/'>Arkansas Tax Deed and Tax Lien Sales</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/arkansas-guides-by-city-and-county/'>Arkansas guides by city and county</a><p>Every local guide we publish.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-arkansas/'>We buy houses in Arkansas</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://arkansasag.gov/divisions/public-protection/homes/landlord-and-tenant-rights/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Arkansas Attorney General, Landlord And Tenant Rights (security deposi</a></li></ul><p><em>General information for Arkansas Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Arkansas\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-arkansas/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Arkansas Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/arkansas-landlord-tenant-law-tenant-rights/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "Arkansas Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights", "rank_math_description": "Arkansas landlord tenant law and tenant rights: deposits, notices, entry and selling a rented house. Official sources only.", "rank_math_focus_keyword": "arkansas tenant rights"}, {"slug": "arkansas-eviction-notice", "title": "Arkansas Eviction Notice Rules: Notice Types, Days and Selling the House", "content": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>.wsp-hero{position:relative;margin:0 calc(-50vw + 50%);padding:5rem 1.5rem;background-image:none;background:linear-gradient(170deg,#12293f 0%,#0c1c2e 46%,#060c16 100%);overflow:hidden;}.wsp-hero-inner{max-width:1216px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:center;}.wsp-hero-left{text-align:center;}.wsp-hero-left h1{color:#fff;font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 1rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3);}.wsp-hero-left h2{color:#fff;font-weight:300;font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 1rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3);}.wsp-hero-left p{color:#fff;font-size:1rem;font-weight:300;max-width:500px;margin:0 a