wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Arkansas Eviction Notice Rules: Notice Types, Days and Selling the House</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Arkansas</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Arkansas Eviction Notice Rules: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Arkansas Eviction Notice Rules sale</li><li>Turn the Arkansas Eviction Notice Rules offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Arkansas House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>Arkansas law requires a landlord to give a specific written notice before filing an eviction, and the number of days depends on the reason.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>Nonpayment of rent: landlord must give three days&#x27; written notice to vacate; if tenant does not leave, landlord sues by complaint in court (unlawful detainer). (Arkansas Attorney General, Landlord And Tenant Rights; <a href='https://arkansasag.gov/divisions/public-protection/homes/landlord-and-tenant-rights/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>After service of summons, tenant has five days to object in writing filed with the court clerk; if no objection, the county sheriff can remove the tenant; if objection, a hearing is scheduled. (Arkansas Attorney General, Landlord And Tenant Rights; <a href='https://arkansasag.gov/divisions/public-protection/homes/landlord-and-tenant-rights/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>No-cause termination: one rental period&#x27;s notice for an oral lease, or as the written lease provides. (Arkansas Attorney General, Landlord And Tenant Rights; <a href='https://arkansasag.gov/divisions/public-protection/homes/landlord-and-tenant-rights/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Arkansas?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Arkansas houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/arkansas-landlord-tenant-law-tenant-rights/'>Arkansas Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/arkansas-tax-deed-and-tax-lien-sales/'>Arkansas Tax Deed and Tax Lien Sales</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/arkansas-guides-by-city-and-county/'>Arkansas guides by city and county</a><p>Every local guide we publish.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-arkansas/'>We buy houses in Arkansas</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://arkansasag.gov/divisions/public-protection/homes/landlord-and-tenant-rights/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Arkansas Attorney General, Landlord And Tenant Rights</a></li></ul><p><em>General information for Arkansas Eviction Notice Rules, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Arkansas\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-arkansas/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Arkansas Eviction Notice: Types and Days\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/arkansas-eviction-notice/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "Arkansas Eviction Notice: Types and Days", "rank_math_description": "Arkansas eviction notice rules: notice types, required days, which court hears the case and selling a rental. Official sources.", "rank_math_focus_keyword": "arkansas eviction notice"}, {"slug": "arkansas-tax-deed-and-tax-lien-sales", "title": "Arkansas Tax Deed and Tax Lien Sales: Process, Redemption and Selling First", "content": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>.wsp-hero{position:relative;margin:0 calc(-50vw + 50%);padding:5rem 1.5rem;background-image:none;background:linear-gradient(170deg,#12293f 0%,#0c1c2e 46%,#060c16 100%);overflow:hidden;}.wsp-hero-inner{max-width:1216px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:center;}.wsp-hero-left{text-align:center;}.wsp-hero-left h1{