us:40px !important;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(224,168,60,.25),0 8px 26px rgba(224,168,60,.5) !important;text-shadow:none !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call strong{color:#16203A !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call:hover{background:#fff !important;border-color:#fff !important;}</style><div class='wsp-hero'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Arkansas Tax Deed and Tax Lien Sales: Process, Redemption and Selling First</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Arkansas</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Arkansas Tax Deed and Tax Lien Sales: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Arkansas Tax Deed and Tax Lien Sales sale</li><li>Turn the Arkansas Tax Deed and Tax Lien Sales offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Arkansas House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>When property tax goes unpaid in Arkansas, the statutes allow the taxing authority to sell a lien or the property itself, and they give the owner a set time to redeem.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>Sale date must be no earlier than one year after the tax-delinquent parcel is certified to the Commissioner of State Lands. (26 CAR 400-104; <a href='https://codeofarrules.arkansas.gov/Rules/Rule?levelType=section&titleID=26&chapterID=223&subChapterID=272&partID=1001&subPartID=5832&sectionID=38048' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Until the parcel is sold or disposed of by the state, a person may redeem by petition to the Commissioner plus payment of outstanding taxes, penalties, interest, fees and costs; effective July 1, 2023 petitions and payment must be received before 4:00 p.m. CT on the last business day before the auction; partial payments do not extend redemption. (26 CAR 400-108; <a href='https://codeofarrules.arkansas.gov/Rules/Rule?levelType=section&titleID=26&chapterID=223&subChapterID=272&partID=1001&subPartID=5832&sectionID=38052' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Money from a tax-delinquent sale above taxes, fees, penalties, interest and costs is excess proceeds, distributed on application per statute (Ark. Code 26-37-205); any remainder is held in trust by the Commissioner of State Lands for the former owner. (26 CAR 400-401; <a href='https://codeofarrules.arkansas.gov/Rules/Rule?chapterID=223&levelType=section&partID=1001&sectionID=38067&subChapterID=272&subPartID=5835&titleID=26' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Arkansas?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Arkansas houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/arkansas-landlord-tenant-law-tenant-rights/'>Arkansas Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/arkansas-eviction-notice/'>Arkansas Eviction Notice: Types and Days</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/arkansas-guides-by-city-and-county/'>Arkansas guides by city and county</a><p>Every local guide we publish.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-arkansas/'>We buy houses in Arkansas</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://codeofarrules.arkansas.gov/Rules/Rule?levelType=section&titleID=26&chapterID=223&subChapterID=272&partID=1001&subPartID=5832&sectionID=38048' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>26 CAR 400-104</a></li><li><a href='https://codeofarrules.arkansas.gov/Rules/Rule?levelType=section&titleID=26&chapterID=223&subChapterID=272&partID=1001&subPartID=5832&sectionID=38052' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>26 CAR 400-108</a></li><li><a href='https://codeofarrules.arkansas.gov/Rules/Rule?chapterID=223&levelType=section&partID=1001&sectionID=38067&subChapterID=272&subPartID=5835&titleID=26' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>26 CAR 400-401</a></li></ul><p><em>General information for Arkansas Tax Deed and Tax Lien Sales, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://ca